    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Owen Reilly proudly presents a truly extraordinary penthouse residence offering complete privacy and security, uninterrupted views over Dublin Bay, and a level of luxury rarely found in the capital. This one-of-a-kind home boasts expansive interiors, exquisite finishes, A2 BER rating and extensive wraparound terraces.\r\n\r\nAt its core lies a dramatic, double-height, open-plan living, dining, and kitchen space with three floor-to-ceiling glazed doors  opening onto multiple terraces. The sculptural stone island anchors the sleek, fully integrated kitchen, while a striking steel staircase ascends to a mezzanine featuring custom joinery, a reading retreat, and a refined home office alcove. The adjacent lounge and dining areas provide a seamless flow for entertaining with a large entertainment unit with integrated TV.\r\n\r\nThe principal suite is a private sanctuary, offering exceptional volume and spa-grade amenities including a freestanding stone bath, walk-in shower, sauna, steam room, dual marble vanities, and access to a secluded terrace with an ice bath. A clever and discreet sliding partition provides flexibility while maintaining flow and light. Two additional double bedrooms—one with a vaulted ceiling, private balcony and en-suite—are perfect for guests or family, complemented by a stylish guest bathroom with walk-in shower.\r\n\r\nLocated moments from Blackrock Village and the coastline, this penthouse offers more than a place to live—it delivers a rare and elevated lifestyle.\r\n\r\nMore about the location...\r\n\r\nLocated south-east of Dublin City, Rockpoint is situated in the affluent south Dublin village of Blackrock, a highly sought after residential area. The development benefits from close proximity to a number of easily accessible employment hubs and recreational amenities. Seapoint Dart Station is located less than a 5 minute walk from the property providing easy access into Dublin City Centre within 15 minutes, while a quality bus corridor is located on Rockpoint's doorstep. Additionally there are superb local shopping and leisure amenities in the nearby surrounding area, with newly refurbished Frascati Shopping Centre and Blackrock Centre including retailers such as the Marks & Spencer, Aldi & SuperValu located only a 5 minute walk away. Blackrock Park, Seapoint Beach and numerous sports facilities and leisure facilities are also within walking distance of Rockpoint."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "The most unique penthouse in South Dublin.\r\nAmazing bedroom suite with spa facilities.\r\nImpressive, triple aspect, open plan living/dining/kitchen space with double height ceiling.\r\nOffering total privacy and security.\r\nThree large double bedrooms.\r\nState of the art kitchen featuring premium appliances and a sculptural stone island.\r\nVaulted ceilings spanning the whole property.\r\nHigh-spec fittings, bespoke joinery, and attention to detail in every corner.\r\nAmple secure underground parking.\r\nOn-site resident services manager.\r\nJust a 5-minute walk to both DART and bus services, connecting you effortlessly to Dublin city and beyond.\r\nUninterrupted Panoramic views of Dublin Bay and the Dublin Mountains from every angle.\r\nA2 BER."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
